# Page Rules

## Pages are server components
Fetch data at the top of the page using /lib/ utilities. Pass data down to components as props.
No useEffect. No fetch() calls. No useState (except in FilterBar which is already built).

## Data utilities
- getAllIncidents() · getIncidentByRef(ref) · getFeaturedIncidents()
- getOpenIncidents() · getDisputedIncidents()
- getAllOralHistories() · getOralHistoryByRef(ref) · getOralHistoriesByIncidentRef(ref)

## Dynamic routes
Every [ref] route must export generateStaticParams.
```ts
export async function generateStaticParams() {
  const items = getAllIncidents()
  return items.map(i => ({ ref: i.ref }))
}
```

## Page composition
Import and compose from /components only. No component logic inside page files.

